        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Going to re-bump this for the new year. This really should be exposed so we don't have to constantly use the UI.Dropdown as a stupid proxy.\n\nI _especially_ need to be able to call TMP_Dropdown.SetValueWithoutNotify in order to make reactive UIs with TMP. It is just a TMP equivalent of Dropdown and should have the same exposure as such within Udon at bare minimum.\n\nI would also add that supporting TMP_InputField is just as important.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
